posts.text:
Health care fraud continues to be uncovered across Minnesota.

@FBIDirectorKash and @FBIMinneapolis are working to investigate and combat fraud that has plagued our state for years, thanks to Tim Walz, Keith Ellison, and Peggy Flanagan. 

Minnesotans deserve accountability, and the War on Fraud will continue until all those responsible are brought to justice.

Our elections have been flooded with illegal voters for too long. 

@DHSgov and @HSI_HQ have been working hard to ensure that these criminals never get to vote in another election and are brought to justice. 

The Senate needs to pass the SAVE America Act immediately to ensure that election fraud is no longer possible in our country.

@SecKennedy and @DrOzCMS are continuing to combat health care waste, fraud, and abuse across the country. 

Our government has wasted billions on duplicative payments and lost billions because of a lack of oversight. 

It is great to see two leaders willing to do the work to clean it up and protect these programs for the Americans who rely on them.
